OL,3,GNEWSATwo homes engulfed in flames after
OL,4,Avillage fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo homes were engulfed in flames after
OL,7,Fa fire in a village.
OL,9,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,10,Fwas initially called to a fire at one
OL,11,Fhome in Felsham Road, Cockfield at
OL,12,F20:56 BST on Wednesday but it spread to
OL,13,Fa neighbouring property and "both homes
OL,14,Fwere fully alight".
OL,16,FSeven crews and several specialist
OL,17,Fvehicles were at the scene at the
OL,18,Fheight of the blaze.
OL,20,FOccupants of both homes were accounted
OL,21,Ffor and the fire was extinguished by
OL,22,F22:48, the fire service said.
